===== kor seo --help
Technical SEO: audit, Search Console/GA4, content, bulk meta, logs, competitors, agent team, opportunities

Usage: kor seo [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  audit          Crawl a site (robots.txt and rate limit obeyed) and report technical SEO findings with URL, line and rule
  verify         Re-scan the pages of the latest audit and show which findings are fixed
  bing           Bing Webmaster Tools (your own API key, read-only)
  gsc            Google Search Console and GA4 (read-only, your own OAuth client)
  content        Content pipeline: brief → outline → draft → SEO check → review → publish
  meta           Bulk titles, descriptions and alt text
  logs           Analyse access logs: bots, crawl budget, status codes, never-crawled URLs
  competitors    Watch competitor pages over time
  agents         Specialised SEO audit agent team with one consolidated report
  opportunities  Ranking opportunity score per query or page from Search Console data
  backlinks      Backlink numbers from Ahrefs, Semrush or Moz (your own key)
  competition    SERP competition factors of a keyword from its ranking pages
  help           Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
