          Search Console property (sc-domain:example.com or https://example.com/) or site

Options:
      --depth <DEPTH>
          Audit depth: quick, full or forensic
          
          [default: quick]
          [possible values: quick, full, forensic]

      --lang <LANG>
          Interface language (tr, en, fr)

      --agents <AGENTS>
          Only these agents (e.g. technical,performance)

      --privacy-mode
          Privacy mode: local models only, no outbound calls from Kor

      --log <LOG>
          Access log for the log agent

      --remote <REMOTE>
          Run the agent on this server over SSH: user@host[:port] or a connections.toml id

      --verify-dns
          Verify search bots by reverse DNS (uses the network)

      --fix
          Write the fix list, redirect rules and Search Console URL list to .kor/seo/fixes

      --no-model
          No model summary

      --notify
          Send a summary to the configured notification channels

      --schedule <SCHEDULE>
          Repeat daily or weekly (adds a routine)
          
          [possible values: daily, weekly]

      --json
          Print JSON

  -m, --model <MODEL>
          Model (provider/model); default: the cost router's route

  -h, --help
          Print help
