  install    Register the native messaging host and show how to load the extension
  uninstall  Remove the native messaging host registrations
  status     Extension, pairing and domain status
  allow      Let Kor open and act on a domain (and its subdomains)
  deny       Never let Kor open or act on a domain
  domains    The allow and deny lists
  profile    Form filler profiles (kept in the OS keychain)
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

