===== kor media --help
Image, video and audio generation: capability catalog across providers, missing-parameter card, gallery and derivation chain, fal models; outputs under kor-media/

Usage: kor media [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  models    Search fal models by text or category, or show one model's inputs and price
  run       Run any fal model with a JSON input (asks for missing required inputs; Ctrl-C cancels)
  image     Generate an image from a prompt (default model fal-ai/flux/schnell)
  generate  Generate with a catalog model; asks for missing parameters (size, duration, voice, style…) first
  gallery   Media generated in this project, newest first
  show      One gallery item: preview, parameters and derivation chain
  derive    A quick action on a gallery item: variation, reseed, upscale, video, remove-bg, edit
  export    Copy a gallery item into the project (e.g. public/logo.png)
  jobs      Requests still running at the provider, not collected yet
  collect   Wait for a queued request (all when none given) and save it to the gallery
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --lang <LANG>
          Interface language (tr, en, fr)

      --privacy-mode
          Privacy mode: local models only, no outbound calls from Kor

      --remote <REMOTE>
          Run the agent on this server over SSH: user@host[:port] or a connections.toml id

  -h, --help
          Print help
