===== kor graph --help
Live project graph: status and hotspots, or a subcommand (spec §7)

Usage: kor graph [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  status    Nodes, edges, communities, files and the last update
  explain   Source, community, degree, callers, callees and decisions of a symbol or file
  path      Shortest path between two concepts
  query     Search the graph by words or identifiers
  hotspots  Risk map: high degree × high churn
  diff      How the graph changed since a git revision
  impact    What depends on a symbol, file or package (pkg:<name>)
  export    Export the graph (Kor JSON, Mermaid, Obsidian vault, HTML, graphify graph.json)
  update    Rescan the whole project now
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

