  search       Search a plugin index (JSON file or URL from --index or KOR_PLUGIN_INDEX)
  create       Create a WASM plugin project, or pack a Claude Code skill folder into one
  revoke       Take back a capability from an installed plugin (all of them when none is given)
  run          Run an installed WASM plugin with the capabilities it holds
  enable       Enable a plugin
  disable      Disable a plugin
  update       Update a plugin
  doctor       Check a plugin's install and files
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --lang <LANG>
          Interface language (tr, en, fr)

      --privacy-mode
          Privacy mode: local models only, no outbound calls from Kor

      --remote <REMOTE>
          Run the agent on this server over SSH: user@host[:port] or a connections.toml id

  -h, --help
          Print help
