===== kor chat --help
Send one prompt and stream the reply (no tools)

Usage: kor chat [OPTIONS] --model <MODEL> <PROMPT>...

Arguments:
  <PROMPT>...
          Prompt text

Options:
      --lang <LANG>
          Interface language (tr, en, fr)

  -m, --model <MODEL>
          Model as provider/model, for example venice/llama-3.3-70b

      --privacy-mode
          Privacy mode: local models only, no outbound calls from Kor

  -s, --system <SYSTEM>
          System prompt

      --max-tokens <MAX_TOKENS>
          Maximum output tokens

      --remote <REMOTE>
          Run the agent on this server over SSH: user@host[:port] or a connections.toml id

